recommend keep-going the width boundary in glow/rune_shape.rye -- five published usize fields and five accessors move to u32, and the 16 casts in lower_shape.rye and 17 in lower_named_cast.rye fall out, both of those already gated at zero authored usize on the 45-module roster. Measured and waiting: 19 flagged lines in rune_shape.rye, 2 in nest_type.rye. Beside it, caravan_subscribe_poll_signal is RED on this pier and stands outside caravan_suite, which wants its own lap. Gated and unchanged: %230, %252, %255, %281, and the 59 gate fixtures.
